
### **Run Tests:**

#### **Unit Tests:**
```bash
# Run auth service unit tests
docker-compose exec auth-service npm test

# Run payment service unit tests
docker-compose exec payment-service npm test

# Run with coverage
docker-compose exec auth-service npm run test:cov
docker-compose exec payment-service npm run test:cov




## 🚀 **Create a Test Runner Script:**

```bash
cat > run-tests.sh << 'EOF'
#!/bin/bash
echo "🚀 Running Opareta Payment System Tests"
echo "========================================"

echo -e "\n🔐 Auth Service Tests:"
docker-compose exec auth-service npm test -- --coverage --testNamePattern="Auth"

echo -e "\n💳 Payment Service Tests:"
docker-compose exec payment-service npm test -- --coverage --testNamePattern="Payment"

echo -e "\n📊 Integration Tests:"
# Add your integration test commands here

echo -e "\n✅ All tests completed!"
EOF

chmod +x run-tests.sh